/Title (i let it get to me a lot. i think about a younger version of myself, with different friends, different goals, and many times wish i was right back there. i feel now like i was having more fun then, but what's strange is that i know i was pretty miserable at that point of my life. chances are i'll slip deeper into this thought process in another handful of years, and think right now, 2018 was actually a great point in my life. anybody else feel this way? i know part of it is just growing up, but i'm tired of hearing "live in the moment". i can't do it. how do i? i want to.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3252 0 R
